"icon:lock[title=Fixed at build time] [[quarkus-datasource_quarkus-datasource-devservices-reuse]] [.property-path]##link:#quarkus-datasource_quarkus-datasource-devservices-reuse[`+++quarkus.datasource.devservices.reuse+++`]##\n"
