"[[quarkus-agroal_quarkus-datasource-jdbc-enable-recovery]] [.property-path]##link:#quarkus-agroal_quarkus-datasource-jdbc-enable-recovery[`+++quarkus.datasource.jdbc.enable-recovery+++`]##\n"
